  _senarioImage: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: af60050f15f740d4894ba5250b7c5fb3, type: 3}
  _forground: {fileID: 0}
  _senarioDescription: 'You call out to the mysterious figure who immediately flips
    itself to look at you with what you would assume to be its eyes.  Glowing brightly
    and with an immediate and sudden flash that leaves you blind. You feel a gust
    of wind blast past you, and hear a loud thud sound from outside. Once you regained
    your sight, it was gone; the only thing remaining as evidence of its existence,
    a few footprints in the yard leading to the forest, leaving you wondering if
    whatever it was was even human. (Must have been the wind - Ending) '
